Description: SDL2 for Termux with native Termux:X11 gamepad support
 This build provides fake udev/evdev as the default controller route and links
 SDL to libtermux-gamepad as a fallback when LD_PRELOAD is rejected. It
 supports runtime XInput and DirectInput identities, hotplug, rumble, trigger
 rumble and SDL haptic effects, with automatic duplicate suppression while
 preserving Termux exec path translation for graphical launchers.
